+## AVO-Method Adoption for the Live Agent (MANDATORY — 2026-08-21)
+
+**Origin:** 2026-08-21 operator directive, verbatim:
+
+> "our new immediate goal is replicating the success of nvidia EVO for our live
+>  agent only with Qwen 3.8 27b instead of Claude, as well as how their harness
+>  iterated its own autogenerated way to finding this success on its own. the
+>  cannot project needs to embrace the methods used."
+
+("EVO" is AVO, NVIDIA's Agentic Variation Operators harness. "cannot" is Carnot.)
+
+**What AVO is, as reported.** AVO is a harness around Claude Opus 5. The agent is
+the mutation operator inside an evolutionary search: it chooses which documents
+to read, which lines to change, and when to benchmark. A supervisor agent audits
+the trajectory when progress stalls and proposes a new strategic direction. It
+ran about 7 days, explored 500+ directions, and beat expert-tuned kernels. It
+also scored 100% on the ARC-AGI-3 public set of 183 puzzles with no prior
+instruction, against about 30% for the bare model. Treat every number here as
+SECONDARY-SOURCE until confirmed against NVIDIA's own writeup.
+
+**Why this matters to Carnot.** Our public-set result is also 183/183
+(`ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml`). We reached it with 25 hand-built per-game
+adapters in `python/carnot/agentic/arc_game_adapters.py`. AVO reached it
+generally. The gap is not the score. The gap is that our solves do not transfer
+to a hidden game and theirs plausibly do. The 100%-versus-30% split also states
+this project's own thesis as a measurement: the value is the harness, not the
+weights.
+
+**The rule.** Until the operator retires it, ARC work targets two goals together:
+
+1. **Replicate the AVO result on the LIVE agent with Qwen3.8-27B, not Claude.**
+   The scored path runs offline with no internet. Any design that assumes
+   frontier-model reasoning is a failed design. State, for each borrowed
+   mechanism, whether it survives on a 27B local model, needs a cheaper
+   substitute (verifier-driven selection, structured search, an explicit
+   archive), or does not carry at all.
+2. **Adopt the SELF-DIRECTED SEARCH METHOD, not only the architecture.** The
+   operator's second clause is the harder half: the harness "iterated its own
+   autogenerated way to finding this success on its own." The transferable
+   question is what the harness did WHEN IT DID NOT KNOW WHAT TO DO NEXT. Copying
+   an architecture diagram without that mechanism misses the directive.
+
+**Scope.** LIVE AGENT. `E3AgentPolicy` / `make_carnot_agent`, per the ARC
+Live-Path Reachability Discipline. Work not reachable from those two entrypoints
+does not count, however good it is.
+
+**Known blocking prerequisite (measured 2026-08-20).** Agent-as-mutation-operator
+needs tool calls. The scored vLLM server is launched with no
+`--enable-auto-tool-choice` and no `--tool-call-parser`, and returns HTTP 400 on
+any request carrying `tools`. With the flags plus `--tool-call-parser hermes` the
+request is accepted but nothing is lifted, because Qwen3.8 emits
+`<tool_call><function=NAME><parameter=code>` XML that hermes cannot parse. The
+pinned wheel registers `qwen3_xml` and `qwen3_coder`; `qwen3_xml` is the untested
+leading candidate. Evidence:
+`/home/ianblenke/.claude/jobs/ad0c053d/tmp/offplay_out5/offline_play.json`.
+
+**How to apply (planner-side).** Reserve ARC slots for this program. Prefer tasks
+that make the live agent more self-directed over tasks that add another per-game
+adapter. A task that raises the public-set count but adds no reusable method is
+churn under this rule.
+
+**How to apply (agent-side).** When you borrow an AVO mechanism, name the
+substitute you use in place of Opus 5, and say how you will know it worked.
+
+**Retirement.** When the operator retires it, or when the live agent reaches a
+hidden game result that this program set out to produce.
